- Kind_ID: ID of student
- Schulbesuchsjahr: Number of student's year at school
- GB: Has the student an intellectual disability? (y/n)
- Alter: Age of student
- Geschlecht: Gender of student (0 = female, 1 = male, 2 = nonbinary)
- SPF: Has the student special educational needs? (y/n)
- LRS: Has the student a reading disorder? (y/n)
- Items starting with "B": Items of the flash reading subscale
- Items starting with "P": Items of the phonological awareness subscale
- Items starting with "S": Items of the sentence comprehension subscle
- Items starting with "W": Items of the vocabulaty comprehension subscale
- Sum_1: Sum of Phonological Awareness
- Sum_2: Sum of Vocabulary
- Sum_3: Sum of Flash Reading
- Sum_4: Sum of Sentence Comprehension
- Err_1: Number of wrong answers of Phonological Awareness
- Err_2: Number of wrong answers of Vocabulary
- Err_3: Number of wrong answers of Flash Reading
- Err_4: Number of wrong answers of Sentence Comprehension
- All_1: Number of answered items of Phonological Awareness
- All_2: Number of answered items of Vocabulary
- All_3: Number of answered items of Flash Reading
- All_4: Number of answered items of Sentence Comprehension
